---
import ContactForm from './ContactForm.astro'
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro'
---
<section id="contact" class="design-section relative border-b border-[#bdc7d2] scroll-mt-[90px]"><div class="section-inner contact-layout mx-auto grid max-w-[1440px] grid-cols-[38%_62%] gap-0 px-[3.7%] py-[46px] max-md:grid-cols-1 max-md:gap-7 max-md:px-6 max-md:py-[34px] min-[1440px]:px-[54px]"><div data-reveal>
<SectionHeading number="05" title="CONTACT" description="Web制作・開発のご相談" />
<div class="contact-copy mt-12 max-w-[340px] pr-7 text-sm leading-[2] max-md:mt-5 max-md:max-w-none max-md:pr-0"><p class="contact-copy-paragraph">お仕事のご相談・ご依頼は、<br />こちらのフォームからお送りください。</p><p class="contact-copy-paragraph mt-5 text-[#5b6675]">依頼内容、希望時期、決まっている範囲をお知らせください。仕様が未確定でも大丈夫です。</p></div>
</div><div data-reveal><ContactForm /></div></div></section>
